Hi all 🤲🏼
I want to introduce specialized property metadata service objects dedicated to selected objects. This change aims to segregate dedicated metadata mapping for selected content/media, providing greater control over extensive metadata manipulation, which is applicable to specific entities

For example:

```csharp
internal class SlugMetaDataService : IEnterspeedPropertyMetaDataService
{
    public bool IsAllowed(IPublishedContent content)
        => content is not null;

    public void MapAdditionalMetaData(Dictionary<string, IEnterspeedProperty> metaData, IPublishedContent content, string culture)
    {
        // some logic

        metaData["slug"] = new ArrayEnterspeedProperty("slug", slug);
    }
}
```

I've retained the previous method to ensure backward compatibility.

If possible, I would greatly appreciate it if you could label this pull request with HACKTOBERFEST-ACCEPTED. Thank you!🙌🏻 

